--      was MISSING 13.6km2 of NDW's official "ZE Den Haag Kust" zone (start 2026-01-01).
--      Centrum matched 99.9pct (0.009km2 gap). Prod-extra-not-in-NDW = 0.023km2.
--      Conclusion: prod was incomplete vs the harmonized + newer NDW source.
--
-- ACTION (single transaction):
--   1. snapshot old row into _meta of a backup note (pg_dump taken separately too)
--   2. DELETE old union row  (zone_id = 'denhaag_ze_zone_2025')
--   3. INSERT denhaag_centrum_ze_zone_2025  (NDW "ZE Den Haag",       eff 2025-01-01)
--   4. INSERT denhaag_kust_ze_zone_2026     (NDW "ZE Den Haag Kust",  eff 2026-01-01)
--
-- Temporal correctness: Kust enforcement starts 2026-01-01, so it MUST be a separate
-- row with its own effective_from - a single union would wrongly imply 2025 coverage.
--
-- Verification (2026-06-01): Centrum 7.4336km2 1-part valid, sanity 7/7;
--                            Kust 41.2635km2 1-part valid, sanity 7/7.
